The '''Rusty Anchor''' is a {{Rare}} [[Reforge Stone]] that applies the {{Ref|Treacherous}} [[Reforge]] to a [[Fishing Rod]], which grants {{stat|str}}, {{stat|treasure chance}} and {{stat|scc}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Rusty Anchor''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Terry}} for {{Item|Hunk of Blue Ice|amount=64}}.

==Usage==
===Reforging===
'''Rusty Anchor''' can be applied to [[Fishing Rods]] using an [[Anvil]] or [[The Hex]] to apply the {{Reforge|Treacherous}} reforge, to grant {{Stat|str}}, {{stat|treasure chance}} and {{stat|scc}}, which scale with the Fishing Rod's rarity. This has no {{skill|mining}} requirement.

Additionally, it grants the '''{{blue|Treacherous Bonus}}''', which grants {{green|+20%}} {{item|Ice Essence}} from '''{{Gold|TREASURE}}''' catches.

