==Trivia==
*Prior to the [https://hypixel.net/threads/november-30-skyblock-patch-notes.5185776/ November 30, 2022 patch], the {{ref|Treacherous}} was obtained from {{NPCSprite|Terry}} directly, instead of being accessible via a [[Reforge Stone]].

